00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,600
 A principle that has become very meaningful in our family. We keep the commandments because

2
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:13,680
 we love God, not merely because we hope to receive the blessings that come from obedience.

3
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:22,240
 Commandments are given to draw us closer to the Savior, to protect us and to help us remain free

4
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,160
 from sin and many of the children.

